hadiths[29]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1052","ahya related to me from Malik that Nafi said"
"1053","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad disapproved of eating game that had been killed with throwing sticks and by clay pellets"
"1056","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard Nafi say that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1059","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Sad al- Jari"
"1060","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman from Abu Hurayra and Zayd ibn Thabit that they saw no harm in eating what was cast up by the sea"
"1061","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman that some people from al-Jar came to Marwan ibn al- Hakam and asked him about eating what was cast up by the sea. He said"
"1062","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shibab from Abu Idris al- Khawlani from Abu Tha~laba al-Khushani that the Messenger of Allah"
"1063","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ismail ibn Abi Hakim from Abiyda ibn Sufyan al-Hadrami from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1064","Yahya related to me from Malik that the best of what he had heard about horses"
"1065","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ibn Wala al-Misri from Abdullah ibn Abbas that the Messenger of Allah"
"1066","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusayt from Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Thawban from his mother that A'isha"
"1098","Yahya related to me from Malik from Malik from Abu Hazim ibn Dinar from Sahl ibn Sad as-Saidi that a woman came to the Messenger of Allah"
"1099","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab had said that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1100","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that the daughter of Ubaydullah ibn Umar whose mother was the daughter of Zayd ibn al- Khattab"
"1101","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz during his khalifate"
"1102","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Said ibn al-Musayyab that 'Umar ibn al-Khattab decided about the woman who was married by a man and the marriage had been consummated"
"1103","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Zayd ibn Thabit said"
"1104","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1105","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm from Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Bakr ibn Abd ar- Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham al-Makhzumi from his father that when the Messenger of Allah"
"1106","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd at-Tawil that Anas ibn Malik said"
"1107","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab was asked about a woman who made a stipulation on her husband not to take her away from her town. Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1108","Yahya related to me from Malik from al-Miswar ibn Rifaa al- Quradhi from az-Zubayr ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn az-Zubayr that Rifaa ibn Simwal divorced his wife"
"1109","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad that A'isha"
"1110","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that when asked whether it was permissible for a man to return to his wife if he had divorced her irrevocably and then another man had married her after him and died before consummating the marriage"
"1111","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1112","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1114","Yahya related to me from Malik from more than one source that when Abdullah ibn Masud was in Kufa"
"1115","Malik said that a man who had committed fornication with a woman and the hadd-punishment had been applied to him for it"
"1116","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim from his father from Abd ar-Rahman and Mujamma the sons of Yazid ibn Jariya al-Ansari from Khansa bint Khidam al-Ansariya that her father gave her in marriage and she had been previously married. She disapproved of that"